msgstr "원래 책을 남겨 둘 공간이 부족합니다"

#: mcomix/shrink_dialog.py:309
#, python-format
msgid ""
"The books shrunk take about %(needed)s on the disk, which has %(free)s free: "
"the books as they were stay in the trash, and keep their room until it is "
"emptied. Deleting them permanently instead frees their room as each book is "
"written."
msgstr ""
"줄인 책은 디스크에서 약 %(needed)s를 차지하지만 여유 공간은 %(free)s입니다. "
"원래 책은 휴지통에 남아 비울 때까지 공간을 차지합니다. 대신 영구히 삭제하면 "
"책을 쓸 때마다 그 공간이 비워집니다."

